      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还是入口之前无法想像味道的茶。这些生活中的\n小惊喜与发现，美丽周日都将它们视为特别的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da8625b5e090e30465f6855a0271978b9360ec7ef5f63e458c12886551ccd8d3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
