    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30cb8b85a026da95e39836c2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是刺激的日子，还是耀眼的生活，全都取决于自己怎么看待。\n而我思考着美丽的意思，被美丽搞得晕头转向的这段日子──",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc6c1e7d8537963b8397ff9ee2773aaeb0a4b2930212696be13a4c88e35bf7c7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
