    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb3d43db139c8d9c7fd9f24f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我希望像美丽周日这样美妙的惊喜能被所有人知道。\n我想支持她奔跑，将她的想法传递给更多的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e90bdd91e666c67b3d80a07cc794399c62dcd55ed3ed5ac6b3cb9bd81731cc8a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1055/storytimeline_041055003.json",
      "json_path": [
